# carlos-emr-restart: "the EMR's Tomcat must (re)start to pick up what this
# transaction changed". Activated by carlos-emr's own configure and by
# carlos-emr-drugref's, so a transaction that configures both deploys the
# ~400 MB webapp ONCE, in the triggered postinst, instead of once per package.
# noawait: the activating package is fully configured without waiting for it.
interest-noawait carlos-emr-restart
